d the mysterious visitor who enchanted the island and meet charming characters from Brazilian folklore and mythologies from around the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras/f7e926f4b5496603b9982b765d7c6288.avif?t=1772564257\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras_big/f7e926f4b5496603b9982b765d7c6288.avif?t=1772564257 width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br>\u2694\ufe0f Strategic turn-based battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles in Sunny Trails are designed for those who enjoy gentle but deep challenges. Analyze each move calmly and face mythical creatures in stylish duels, special combos and surprising magical effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras/263d9702311b006b1633a128eec9e7bc.poster.avif?t=1772564257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras/263d9702311b006b1633a128eec9e7bc.webm?t=1772564257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras/263d9702311b006b1633a128eec9e7bc.mp4?t=1772564257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f A gripping mystery</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in a light and charming atmosphere, there is something dark lurking around the island of magic. As you investigate the uninvited visitor who turned the party guests into stone, you will immerse yourself in a plot full of magic, folklore and emotions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055290/extras/8cc86e72dba2b8690b1104947ac68a12.poster.avif?t=1772564257\" width=800 h